    "legend": "ALK signalling pathways activated downstream of the NPM1::ALK protein. The AKT/mTOR, JAK/STAT, MAPK, and PLC&gamma; pathways are the major pathways activated downstream NPM::ALK protein, leading to the survival and proliferation of tumour cells. However, STAT3 seems to be the major effector of ALK oncogenic activity.",
    "source": "Laurence Lamant-Rochaix",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/44/57/32296.jpg",
